## Verdict: READY WITH CHANGES

All nine round-1 findings are genuinely fixed in the working tree; P1-2's fix in particular generalizes beyond the exact reviewed fixture. Two changes are required before commit, one code (a CLJD test-lane syntax bug) and one process (the fixes are **unstaged** — see below).

